meta {
  name: Public Config
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/config
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Non-sensitive front-end config (app name, logos, PHI-masked environments).

  `environments` lists the environments this deployment has, ordered least → most
  sensitive. It is derived from `DBFORGE_CONNECTIONS`, so it is also the set of
  values every other endpoint accepts for an environment (capability lists,
  masked-envs, direct-write envs) — the client renders its pickers from it.

  **Public** — no auth.
}
